<mcp_servers>
MCP (Model Context Protocol) external server tools are ENABLED.
MCP tools are named mcp__{server}__{tool} (e.g. mcp__github__create_issue).
Use mcp_list_servers to see available servers and their tools.

Approved servers: github,slack
Tools from approved servers can be called directly.
Tools from unapproved servers will trigger a user approval request.

</mcp_servers>
